    "notes": "Functional review passed, but strict process compliance is not fully evidenced. Several early increments executed grouped behavioral Red suites, then implemented multiple independently testable branches together. Genuine Red and Green output is preserved, but it cannot establish the required individual per-behavior edit/execution ordering. Historical evidence cannot be recreated honestly by forcing correct behavior to fail. Final completion remains fail-closed pending resolution of this process limitation.",
