      "ordering": "Negative verification and ownership denial precede persistence. Student, Programme, Course, duplicate and eligibility are evaluated in order; duplicate avoids offering access.",
      "boundaries": "Provider, SQL and GraphQL representations are explicitly converted. Flask is confined to HTTP/bootstrap. Import Linter and source/type fitness tests complement semantic review.",
